    <title>Serela White Marble Bookends | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the Serela white marble bookends by Kave Home, selected by KASODI for their sculptural fan-shaped form, natural stone veining and understated architectural character."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <a href="/interesting-finds">Interesting Finds</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <span>Serela White Marble Bookends</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/interesting-finds/kave-home-serela-white-marble-bookends.png"
            alt="Serela white marble bookends by Kave Home styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT &middot; INTERESTING FINDS
          </p>

          <h1>
            Serela White Marble Bookends
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Kave Home
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A sculptural pair of bookends carved from natural white marble.
            Serela combines a graphic fan-shaped silhouette with softly varied
            stone veining, turning an everyday functional object into a
            distinctive decorative detail for shelves, consoles and bookcases.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>100% Marble</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>31 &times; 5 &times; 15.5 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>White</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Set</span>
              <strong>2 pieces</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Shape</span>
              <strong>Free form</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Weight</span>
              <strong>6.1 kg</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/serela-bookend-in-white-marble?utm_affaid=kasodi"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here &rarr;
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Serela is one of those practical objects that works just as well as
            decoration. The carved fan-like form gives the marble an architectural
            quality, while the warm white stone keeps the overall look quiet and
            easy to incorporate into a room.
          </p>

          <p>
            Because marble is a natural material, each piece has its own subtle
            tonal variations and veining. We especially like the pair styled with
            art and design books, where the weight of the stone feels substantial
            and the sculptural edges remain visible.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Natural stone, simply cared for</h2>

        <p>
          Dust with a soft duster and keep the marble away from direct sources of
          heat and prolonged direct sunlight. Avoid abrasive cleaners, acetone,
          bleach and solvents, and take care with sharp objects that could scratch
          the stone surface.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Art &amp; Design Books</h3>
            <p>
              Neutral book covers allow the sculptural marble edges to remain
              visible while creating a collected, editorial shelf.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Warm Wood</h3>
            <p>
              Walnut, oak and other warm woods bring out the subtle cream tones
              and natural veining of the white marble.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Antique Brass</h3>
            <p>
              A small brass frame, tray or decorative object adds warmth and
              contrast without competing with Serela's graphic shape.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>INTERESTING FINDS</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/interesting-finds/garel-green-marble-decorative-set"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/interesting-finds/kave-home-garel-green-marble-decorative-set.png"
                alt="Garel Green Marble Decorative Set"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>DECORATIVE OBJECTS</span>
              <h3>Garel Green Marble Decorative Set</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/home-decor/lurea-sculptural-glass-centrepiece"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-decor/kave-home-lurea-sculptural-glass-centrepiece.png"
                alt="Lurea Sculptural Glass Centrepiece"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME DECOR</span>
              <h3>Lurea Sculptural Glass Centrepiece</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/home-decor/drava-burgundy-ceramic-table-lamp"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-decor/kave-home-drava-burgundy-ceramic-table-lamp.png"
                alt="Drava Burgundy Ceramic Table Lamp"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>LIGHTING</span>
              <h3>Drava Burgundy Ceramic Table Lamp</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          KAVE HOME &middot; NATURAL MARBLE
        </p>

        <h2>
          A functional object with a sculptural point of view.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://kavehome.com/es/en/p/serela-bookend-in-white-marble?utm_affaid=kasodi"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here &rarr;
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

